{"reference":"Isaiah 46","book":"Isaiah","chapter":46,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Isaiah’s Textual Witnesses","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The Great Isaiah Scroll preserves almost the whole sixty-six-chapter book of Isaiah. It broadly aligns with the Masoretic tradition, though it contains thousands of spelling and substantive differences. Other Qumran Isaiah manuscripts and interpretive writings also show that Isaiah was actively copied and interpreted; the significance of these differences remains disputed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_isaiah_046_3bb0dd448705c9919a90f740"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}